    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57260" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρύλος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ], ὁ</span>, fabulous sea-bird, sts.
